# kdos-con layout: work — a terminal, the file manager, the monitor.
#
# THE ROWS NAME ROLES AND `con.conf` NAMES THE PROGRAMS. `files` is whatever
# that key says a file manager is and `monitor` whatever it says the resource
# monitor is, so this file survives somebody preferring a different one — and
# it holds no command line, which is the rule the session record keeps.
#
# A row whose program this image does not carry opens nothing and is not an
# error: a layout that refused to load at all would be one nobody could use.
#
# The rectangles are cells on an 80x24 grid and are fitted to whatever screen
# is actually there. Left half, then the right half split.
#
# kind	workspace	x	y	w	h	app	flags	title
term	0	1	1	38	21	terminal	-	terminal
app	0	41	1	38	9	files	-	files
app	0	41	12	38	10	monitor	-	monitor
